16lu|n|The goddess of the rainbow, and swift-footed messenger of the gods. ; The rainbow. ; An appearance resembling the rainbow; a prismatic play of colors. ; The contractile membrane perforated by the pupil, and forming the colored portion of the eye. See Eye. ; A genus of plants having showy flowers and bulbous or tuberous roots, of which the flower-de-luce (fleur-de-lis), orris, and other species of flag are examples. See Illust. of Flower-de-luce. ; See Fleur-de-lis, 2.	V:je8,39,1~je8,39,1	n:195t,154,24~195t,154,24	N:uxi,118,2;5qg,104,2;1u3c,87,12;je8,85,24;1ltq,70,5;jdw,32,7~je8,85,24;1u3c,87,12;jdw,32,7;1ltq,70,5;uxi,118,2;5qg,104,2
